From: XiaoShao <xiaoshao9704@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] firewall4: propagate ruleset load failures before includes

pipefail sets the pipeline status, but a successful includes command used to
overwrite it. Do not report a successful reload when nft rejected the ruleset.

--- a/root/sbin/fw4
+++ b/root/sbin/fw4
@@ -33,7 +33,7 @@ start() {
 		esac
 
 		ACTION=start \
-			utpl -S $MAIN | nft $VERBOSE -f $STDIN
+			utpl -S $MAIN | nft $VERBOSE -f $STDIN || return 1
 
 		ACTION=includes \
 			utpl -S $MAIN
